The objective of this project is to design and implement an Employee Management System that
efficiently stores and manages employee-related data within an organization. The system needs to track
various aspects of employee information, including personal details, job roles, salary structures,
qualifications, leave records, and payroll data. The system should ensure the integrity and consistency
of data by using relational tables with appropriate foreign keys and cascading actions.
The system should allow for easy management and querying of employee data, providing insights such
as payroll calculation, leave tracking, and department-specific job roles. The goal is to streamline HR
operations, ensuring that all relevant employee data is accessible and accurately updated across
different modules.
